OL,3,ATrump says summit with Xi and Putin in
OL,4,AChina is 'making history'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump, Vladimir Putin, and Xi
OL,7,FJinping are holding talks in the
OL,8,FChinese city of Shenzhen
OL,10,FAs the meeting began, Xi said the talks
OL,11,Fhad "groundbreaking significance" -
OL,12,FTrump said they were "really making
OL,13,Fhistory"
OL,15,FEarlier, Trump held separate, bilateral
OL,16,Fmeetings with Putin and Xi - he called
OL,17,FPutin his "friend" and said they have a
OL,18,F"great relationship". Watch the moment
OL,19,Fhere
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
