OL,3,ATrump says summit with Xi and Putin in
OL,4,AChina is 'making history'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Putin's aides said the bilateral
OL,7,Fmeeting with Trump went "well", with
OL,8,FPutin in an "excellent mood"
OL,10,FAfter meeting Xi, Trump said the US and
OL,11,FChina want to see an end to the Ukraine
OL,12,Fwar
